@startsalt
' Screen: Node Detail / Inspector Panel (expanded)
' User Stories:
'   - As a tester, I can view and edit the details of a selected node
'   - As a tester, I can change or update the attached prompt version
'   - As a tester, I can add, edit, and remove expectations on a node
'   - As a tester, I can bind template variables for the node's prompt
'   - As a tester, I can leave and resolve comments on a node

{
  == Inspector: greeting ==
  ..
  {
    <b>Kind:</b>  [User Turn ▼]     |  <b>Key:</b>  "greeting                "
  }
  ..
  == Attached Prompt ==
  {
    <b>greeting-prompt</b>  <i>v2</i>   |  [Change]
  }
  {+ <color:blue>ℹ A newer version is available (v3). </color>[Update to v3] }
  ..
  == Expectations ==
  {#
    <b>Label</b>              | <b>Weight</b> | <b>Direction</b>  | <b>Scoring</b>
    mentions_product    | 0.6      | positive    | lm_judge
    no_hallucination    | 0.4      | negative    | rubric: hallucination-v1
  }
  [+ Add Expectation]
  ..
  == Variable Bindings ==
  {#
    <b>Template Var</b>       | <b>Value / Source</b>
    {{product_name}}    | "Wireless Headphones       "
    {{user_locale}}     | ^session.locale ▼^
  }
  [+ Add Binding]
  ..
  == Comments ==
  {+
    <b>alice@codefre.sh</b>  <i>2026-05-09</i>
    "Should this node also check for upsell language?"
    [Reply]  [✓ Resolve]
  }
  [+ Add Comment]
}

@endsalt
